WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:03,360
My God, you can still have such a complete hand

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,720
As long as we pick it ourselves

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,360
I have to wait until next month to pick it.

4
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,040
Your mind control is too fine

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,760
You can meet accurate hands again

6
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,800
And he can do such stable work as collecting vegetables.

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,300
Suhao, there is movement at the gate of the breeding base.

8
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,380
Several cows ran out

9
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,760
The one-horned one still stays in the basket and doesn't come out.

10
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,280
She doesn't cause trouble. Don't touch her first.

11
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,240
What about these ordinary ones?

12
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:30,080
Do you want to kill a batch first and save it? That's what I want.

13
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:43,710
Congratulations to the host for completing the hidden mission

14
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,750
Clean up all the jobs and breeding bases

15
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:47,630
Choose another unlimited election once

16
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:54,020
The signal here is much better than before

17
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,620
When we are on our way

18
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,020
Maybe you can listen to the radio

19
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,060
See if there is any news about the survivors of the safe zone
